  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to the Ukraine Energy Support Fund - Phase II</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;Grant to the Energy Community Secretariat to enable contribution to the Ukraine Energy Support Fund. This fund will cover deliveries of equipment, materials and services required for the emergency repairs and other activities necessary for the stable functioning of the Ukrainian energy system.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
